{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "余"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亮潤"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "沉蓮池撰"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲眾等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "蜎飛者，謂微細飛蟲也。蝡動者，謂微細蛆蟲也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此西方非佛說\n西方，乃對震旦國言耳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此非為淨土而發，然修淨業者不可不知。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "行道念佛，謂拜佛繞佛而念。如此念佛，身口意俱到，故功德獨勝。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見蓮池疏鈔"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此二語出蓮池師"}
